TMHMM2.0.model
--------------
Parameters of TMHMM 2.0 (A. Krogh, B. Larsson, G. von Heijne, E. L. L. Sonnhammer,
J Mol Biol 305:567-580, 2001), as distributed with pyTMHMM. The model belongs to DTU
Health Tech and is covered by DTU's academic licence for TMHMM 2.0
(https://services.healthtech.dtu.dk/services/TMHMM-2.0/): free for academic,
non-commercial use; redistribution needs DTU's permission. tmhmm.py therefore does not
ship it. If this code is published, keep the file out of the public repository and let
users download TMHMM 2.0 from DTU (the model file is in the package) and point the
TMHMM_MODEL environment variable at it, or drop it into this folder.
